#: ../../library/hashlib.rst:383
msgid ""
"**BLAKE2b**, optimized for 64-bit platforms and produces digests of any size"
" between 1 and 64 bytes,"
msgstr ""
"**BLAKE2b**, optimalizované pro 64bitové platformy a vyrobá otisky libovolné"
